    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23372" root="شول" body-key="$">
    
      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تشاولوا</span></b>  <i>They reached,</i> or <i>smote, one another,</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَاوَلَ بَعْضُهُمْ بَعْضًا</span>,) <i>in fight, with the spears:</i>
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُشَاوَلَةٌ</span></b>  has a similar signification [to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشَاوُلٌ</span>,
as shown above by an explanation of its verb, 3].
(AZ, S, O.)

